  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_039) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.725). This experiment tests the same RNA and image encoders, aggregation method, but with concat fusion instead of weighted fusion. It clarifies whether the fusion method (concat vs weighted) is the key differentiator for performance, while keeping other factors constant. This comparison isolates the effect of fusion strategy, which is critical for understanding model behavior and maximizing the final experiment's value under the budget constraint."
